{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "IlhaZ",
    "steam_appid": 3797390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797390/extras/3e58d78755805261bf9a638c6807e056.avif?t=1753394511\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IlhaZ: Multiplayer Survival in a World Drowned in Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a global nuclear collapse, the Earth\u2019s surface has become uninhabitable. The last hope for humanity lies in a remote archipelago, where survival is a constant battle against a lethal environment\u2014and each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unforgiving open world, you\u2019ll explore islands teeming with distinct biomes: tropical jungles, frozen tundras, scorching deserts, arid wastelands, and ruined zones left by the collapse. Each location offers new resources to scavenge, but also fresh dangers lurking around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face brutal challenges in both player-versus-player and player-versus-environment combat. Zombies, drawn to the slightest sound or movement, hunt relentlessly, while other survivors may offer fleeting alliances\u2014or become your greatest threat. Fighting is just one part of the struggle; mastering survival means managing hunger, thirst, and body temperature, knowing when to fight, flee, rest, or seek shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797390/extras/2bdd2c9a9013581990bf964870fe0b84.avif?t=1753394511\" data-has-big width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting and looting play a critical role in your journey. Fish from the shores, cook over a fire, or scavenge through abandoned ruins\u2014every item you find could mean the difference between life and death. For those daring enough, vehicles like cars, boats, bikes, and even horses can be repaired and refueled, offering a chance to cross hostile regions, escape zombie-infested areas, or launch strategic raids on enemy bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IlhaZ thrives on its dynamic online multiplayer experience, with customizable servers that let you shape your own story. Join existing communities or create your own, where no two matches are ever alike. This is a cruel, unpredictable survival world where you\u2019re not the hero\u2014just another survivor. And in IlhaZ, one more survivor might just be one too many.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797390/extras/3e58d78755805261bf9a638c6807e056.avif?t=1753394511\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IlhaZ: Multiplayer Survival in a World Drowned in Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a global nuclear collapse, the Earth\u2019s surface has become uninhabitable. The last hope for humanity lies in a remote archipelago, where survival is a constant battle against a lethal environment\u2014and each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unforgiving open world, you\u2019ll explore islands teeming with distinct biomes: tropical jungles, frozen tundras, scorching deserts, arid wastelands, and ruined zones left by the collapse. Each location offers new resources to scavenge, but also fresh dangers lurking around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face brutal challenges in both player-versus-player and player-versus-environment combat. Zombies, drawn to the slightest sound or movement, hunt relentlessly, while other survivors may offer fleeting alliances\u2014or become your greatest threat. Fighting is just one part of the struggle; mastering survival means managing hunger, thirst, and body temperature, knowing when to fight, flee, rest, or seek shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797390/extras/2bdd2c9a9013581990bf964870fe0b84.avif?t=1753394511\" data-has-big width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting and looting play a critical role in your journey. Fish from the shores, cook over a fire, or scavenge through abandoned ruins\u2014every item you find could mean the difference between life and death. For those daring enough, vehicles like cars, boats, bikes, and even horses can be repaired and refueled, offering a chance to cross hostile regions, escape zombie-infested areas, or launch strategic raids on enemy bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IlhaZ thrives on its dynamic online multiplayer experience, with customizable servers that let you shape your own story. Join existing communities or create your own, where no two matches are ever alike. This is a cruel, unpredictable survival world where you\u2019re not the hero\u2014just another survivor. And in IlhaZ, one more survivor might just be one too many.</p>",
    "short_description": "IlhaZ is an online survival game set in a post-apocalyptic archipelago. Survive against zombies, hunger, and harsh weather while interacting with other players in a brutal open world.",
